<p>
    First things first: no, "Whit Waltman" is not my government name. That would be kinda cool though, huh?
    It's actually a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spoonerism">spoonerism</a>
    {% aside "even if you're not familiar with the term, you've probably come across at least one spoonerism in your lifetime, e.g. 'runny babbit'" %}
    of the name of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walt_Whitman">an American poet</a>. I've been using this name for over 5 years now, and it's probably the one I feel most at home in.
</p>

