<p>
    I was born and raised in Southern California. I went to college on the East Coast and am now back home, relishing in the sunshine and warm winter weather.
    I started kayaking during the pandemic, and I picked it up again last year. It's been great for both my physical and mental health;
    I try to go once a week.
</p>

<p>
    I love puzzles. My grandfather introduced me to Sudoku puzzles when I was maybe 6 or 7 years old. I didn't get into crosswords until I was in college, and
    by that point, my interest in puzzles had broadened to anything that falls under the category of logic and word games.
</p>

<p>
